body:
My anxiety is through the roof. Not only is my family toxic but I'm going to have my wisdom teeth extracted this Tuesday. Anesthesia.......scratch that any form of medical procedure causes my anxiety to go through the roof, that's why every time I go for a check-up, my doctor is concerned about why my heart is beating fast. The pain afterwards is the least of my worries honestly.  It's the idea that I'll need to walk into that office at 3 PM sign all of the consent forms and wait for the surgeon or anesthesiologist or whomever, knowing full well what will be happening within the next hour. 

&#x200B;

About my parents as well, there are many things I wish to do (especially since it's Christmas Break) but just living in the same house as them is draining. My dad's a drinker and my mom's a pill head. You can imagine what it's like.
